    "text": "pittsburghsoccernow.com\nwebsite\nPittsburgh\nMatch Reaction and Photo Gallery: Riveters outlast Steel City FC in match brimming with Pittsburgh women’s soccer talent\nBy John Krysinsky,6 days ago\nIt’s rare that a match that has a lot of build up and excitement often lives up to the hype. When Pittsburgh Riveters SC and Steel City FC finally met on the pitch, a large crowd congreagated at Founders Field in Cheswick got to see some high-level Women’s soccer being played between two rosters brimming with homegrown, Pittsburgh-area female soccer talent.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
